WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.980
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.250 --> 01:40.050
[River of No Return]

3
01:40.170 --> 01:43.030
[Episode 5: Posing as a Performer]

4
01:46.150 --> 01:46.810
Godfather!

5
01:47.090 --> 01:47.870
Useless fool!

6
01:47.870 --> 01:48.670
Useless fool!

7
01:50.729 --> 01:51.900
Send them all out.

8
01:52.420 --> 01:53.539
Search thoroughly!

9
01:53.539 --> 01:54.160
Yes!

10
01:54.479 --> 01:55.740
Front rank, follow me!

11
01:55.800 --> 01:57.620
Rear rank, search east along the riverbank!

12
01:57.620 --> 01:58.289
Yes!

13
04:01.480 --> 04:02.340
Your Highness.

14
04:08.700 --> 04:09.560
Your Highness.

15
04:33.560 --> 04:34.040
Come on.

16
04:39.080 --> 04:40.210
Good-for-Nothing,

17
04:40.280 --> 04:41.670
you've done a great service by saving His Highness.

18
04:41.670 --> 04:43.050
When I'm before the throne later,

19
04:43.050 --> 04:44.510
I will report your service

20
04:44.520 --> 04:45.580
to him truthfully.

21
04:47.010 --> 04:48.340
I really didn't expect this.

22
04:48.340 --> 04:49.380
Didn't expect what?

23
04:49.380 --> 04:50.780
You really didn't expect

24
04:51.670 --> 04:53.270
that we'd meet again, right?

25
04:53.730 --> 04:55.530
Yes. Here we are, meeting again.

26
04:56.300 --> 04:57.030
Come on, let's go.

27
04:57.030 --> 04:57.940
Hurry, run!

28
05:13.010 --> 05:13.460
Hurry.

29
05:16.390 --> 05:17.050
Wait.

30
05:22.820 --> 05:23.760
Come on, get on.

31
05:24.370 --> 05:25.380
Go check over there!

32
05:25.380 --> 05:26.450
Hurry, you guys go.

33
05:26.470 --> 05:27.300
I'll lead them away.

34
05:27.300 --> 05:27.760
Go!

35
05:27.780 --> 05:28.250
Okay.

36
05:34.690 --> 05:35.690
Stop right there!

37
05:36.690 --> 05:37.400
Stop!

38
05:42.950 --> 05:43.460
After them!

39
05:43.460 --> 05:44.100
Yes, sir!

40
05:52.460 --> 05:52.960
Stop!

41
05:55.370 --> 05:55.930
Officer,

42
05:56.340 --> 05:57.250
on night patrol?

43
05:57.250 --> 05:58.909
What are you doing out so late?

44
05:59.570 --> 06:00.170
Officer,

45
06:00.490 --> 06:02.340
old Mr. Sun, the blacksmith in South City, is ill.

46
06:02.340 --> 06:02.810
I...

47
06:21.370 --> 06:22.760
I'll beat you to death!

48
06:37.170 --> 06:37.760
Let's go.

49
06:38.830 --> 06:40.690
Hide the carriage and the bodies.

50
06:41.680 --> 06:42.280
Hurry!

51
07:04.780 --> 07:06.510
The Brave Warriors Camp's men.

52
07:11.600 --> 07:13.660
He was struck by a Swallowtail Arrow.

53
07:13.840 --> 07:15.970
The barbed head has hooked into the flesh.

54
07:15.970 --> 07:17.570
We can't pull it out by force.

55
07:19.180 --> 07:20.980
We have to cut the shaft short first.

56
07:20.980 --> 07:23.780
Only then might we be able to remove the arrowhead.

57
07:27.010 --> 07:28.800
His face has turned deathly pale.

58
07:28.800 --> 07:30.260
He has lost too much blood.

59
07:32.840 --> 07:34.590
But cutting the shaft would inevitably

60
07:34.590 --> 07:36.720
tug at the surrounding blood vessels.

61
07:44.720 --> 07:45.770
Your Highness, don't fall asleep.

62
07:45.770 --> 07:48.330
I don't have a single suitable medical instrument here.

63
07:48.330 --> 07:49.840
If we can't stop the bleeding,

64
07:49.840 --> 07:50.640
I'm afraid...

65
07:51.159 --> 07:51.890
Dr. Su,

66
07:52.340 --> 07:53.220
I once read in

67
07:53.600 --> 07:55.780
"The Essentials for Military Campaigns"

68
07:55.780 --> 07:56.950
that the garrison troops in Jinan

69
07:56.950 --> 07:58.510
used cauterization to stop bleeding.

70
07:58.510 --> 07:59.980
Perhaps we could try that method

71
07:59.980 --> 08:01.240
on His Highness first?

72
08:01.510 --> 08:02.410
Cauterization?

73
08:02.410 --> 08:02.920
Yes.

74
08:03.100 --> 08:03.840
Rectifier Yu.

75
08:03.840 --> 08:04.900
Cauterization...

76
08:05.720 --> 08:06.650
Cauterization.

77
08:06.650 --> 08:07.210
What?

78
08:07.540 --> 08:08.540
Hurry up and do it.

79
08:09.390 --> 08:10.680
Why so much talk?

80
08:11.300 --> 08:12.740
-There must be a flatiron here. -Do it.

81
08:12.740 --> 08:13.360
Flatiron.

82
08:13.770 --> 08:15.230
Quickly, find a flatiron!

83
08:16.280 --> 08:17.160
Hurry up!

84
08:31.340 --> 08:33.270
You take it. You'll have to help me.

85
08:33.320 --> 08:34.940
In a moment, when I cut the shaft,

86
08:34.940 --> 08:36.230
as soon as blood starts to seep out,

87
08:36.230 --> 08:37.250
use this flatiron

88
08:38.280 --> 08:39.610
to cauterize the wound.

89
08:39.630 --> 08:40.360
Understand?

90
08:48.420 --> 08:49.220
Are you ready?

91
08:50.130 --> 08:50.930
Wait a minute.

92
08:51.770 --> 08:52.490
Do it.

93
08:54.280 --> 08:55.490
Hurry up and do it.

94
08:55.610 --> 08:56.740
I'll count to three.

95
08:57.700 --> 08:58.490
Do it.

96
08:59.460 --> 09:00.040
One.

97
09:01.770 --> 09:02.370
Two.

98
09:03.280 --> 09:03.770
Three.

99
09:07.940 --> 09:09.140
W-What are you doing?

100
09:09.150 --> 09:10.040
Do it!

101
09:10.590 --> 09:11.820
Do it! Hurry!

102
09:15.010 --> 09:16.030
He's the Crown Prince, but he's still human.

103
09:16.030 --> 09:17.530
He'll die if he bleeds out!

104
09:17.770 --> 09:18.830
What are you doing?

105
09:18.870 --> 09:21.530
Are you just going to stand there and let him die?

106
09:21.540 --> 09:22.410
Do it!

107
09:29.420 --> 09:30.080
Old Mule,

108
09:30.780 --> 09:31.440
hold on.

109
09:32.990 --> 09:33.790
Hang in there.

110
09:34.230 --> 09:34.910
Press it.

111
10:26.180 --> 10:26.920
Dr. Su.

112
10:34.680 --> 10:36.280
Roughly how long will

113
10:38.160 --> 10:40.420
His Highness's arrow wound take to heal?

114
10:41.960 --> 10:43.890
Twenty-odd days at the very least.

115
10:44.530 --> 10:45.530
Twenty-odd days?

116
10:46.010 --> 10:47.130
During that time,

117
10:47.510 --> 10:49.640
the patient can move around on his own.

118
10:50.200 --> 10:52.930
But he needs oral medication, external washing,

119
10:52.990 --> 10:54.540
and massage every day without interruption.

120
10:54.540 --> 10:56.560
Otherwise, if the flesh heals improperly

121
10:56.560 --> 10:58.360
and seals the arrowhead inside,

122
10:58.850 --> 11:01.050
the wound will have to be cut open again.

123
11:01.610 --> 11:02.960
And if the arrowhead

124
11:03.490 --> 11:04.530
is rusty

125
11:04.960 --> 11:06.690
or has been coated with poison,

126
11:08.270 --> 11:10.000
all we can do is leave it to fate.

127
11:42.030 --> 11:43.160
Good-for-Nothing.

128
11:43.670 --> 11:46.860
[Fifth month, Gengchen day: The sovereign suffered from an infirmity and summoned the Crown Prince back.]

129
11:44.560 --> 11:47.090
I'm here to get His Highness something to eat.

130
11:48.630 --> 11:49.560
Little Xingren.

131
11:50.350 --> 11:51.410
Take a look at this.

132
11:51.750 --> 11:52.410
Well...

133
11:53.490 --> 11:54.510
"The sovereign suffered from an infirmity."

134
11:54.510 --> 11:55.510
What does it mean?

135
12:02.030 --> 12:03.030
What does it mean?

136
12:04.610 --> 12:05.490
Nothing.

137
12:21.010 --> 12:21.770
Dr. Su.

138
12:24.150 --> 12:26.080
What does "infirmity" mean?

139
12:28.750 --> 12:29.320
What?

140
12:29.630 --> 12:30.290
Infirmity.

141
12:31.160 --> 12:32.280
Infertility...

142
12:32.890 --> 12:35.960
Well, the causes of infertility are very complex.

143
12:36.330 --> 12:38.460
I can't explain them in a sentence or two.

144
12:38.460 --> 12:39.040
No.

145
12:40.800 --> 12:41.680
"The sovereign suffered from an infirmity."

146
12:41.680 --> 12:43.210
There's also "sovereign."

147
12:44.540 --> 12:45.870
Where did you hear that?

148
12:47.350 --> 12:48.820
"Infirmity" means being ill,

149
12:48.820 --> 12:49.960
seriously ill.

150
12:50.410 --> 12:52.040
To the point of being on the brink of death.

151
12:52.040 --> 12:53.240
On the brink of death?

152
12:53.490 --> 12:56.150
And it means the Emperor is on the brink of death.

153
12:56.530 --> 12:57.800
Why the Emperor?

154
12:59.130 --> 13:00.530
The sovereign suffered from an infirmity.

155
13:00.530 --> 13:02.300
"Sovereign" specifically refers to the emperor,

156
13:02.300 --> 13:03.300
not to commoners.

157
13:31.150 --> 13:32.010
Your Highness.

158
13:33.130 --> 13:35.460
I found one of Good-for-Nothing's robes.

159
13:35.960 --> 13:38.370
It seems to be in fairly good condition.

160
13:40.230 --> 13:41.320
He was probably

161
13:41.530 --> 13:43.280
saving it to wear on his wedding day.

162
13:43.280 --> 13:43.800
No need.

163
13:43.920 --> 13:44.980
I can dress myself.

164
13:48.530 --> 13:49.410
Rectifier Yu.

165
13:50.200 --> 13:51.330
Yes, Your Highness.

166
13:52.390 --> 13:54.050
Where did you find the doctor?

167
13:57.390 --> 13:58.250
Your Highness,

168
13:58.850 --> 13:59.490
the female doctor is...

169
13:59.490 --> 14:01.290
Your Highness the Crown Prince.

170
14:01.660 --> 14:03.660
Lord Yu can't answer that question.

171
14:03.770 --> 14:04.900
My name is Su Jingxi.

172
14:06.160 --> 14:06.770
Yes.

173
14:14.370 --> 14:15.200
Dr. Su,

174
14:16.390 --> 14:17.800
then why did you save me?

175
14:18.750 --> 14:19.770
Because you and I

176
14:21.730 --> 14:22.960
share the same enemy.

177
14:25.730 --> 14:26.770
Zhu Buhua.

178
14:51.030 --> 14:53.090
He couldn't have done all this alone.

179
14:54.160 --> 14:55.920
Someone must be helping him.

180
14:56.320 --> 14:56.890
Zhu Wu.

181
14:57.370 --> 14:57.890
Yes.

182
14:58.610 --> 15:00.850
Send men to search the area between here and Dinghuai Gate.

183
15:00.850 --> 15:02.250
Check every checkpoint set up

184
15:02.250 --> 15:03.630
by the Wardens' Offices of the Five Wards,

185
15:03.630 --> 15:04.800
one by one,

186
15:05.110 --> 15:07.010
and see if anyone has seen this carriage.

187
15:07.010 --> 15:07.530
Yes.

188
15:08.370 --> 15:08.910
Wait.

189
15:14.150 --> 15:14.920
Where are we?

190
15:15.410 --> 15:16.910
We just passed Changle Street.

191
15:16.910 --> 15:18.040
Up ahead is Tangfang Alley.

192
15:18.040 --> 15:20.840
And further in that direction is Zhenhuai Street.

193
15:21.910 --> 15:23.130
Search every household.

194
15:23.130 --> 15:24.340
Don't leave a single one unchecked.

195
15:24.340 --> 15:24.860
Yes.

196
15:25.300 --> 15:25.900
Follow me!

197
15:26.110 --> 15:26.680
Yes, sir!

198
15:34.040 --> 15:34.700
Eunuch Zhu.

199
15:35.350 --> 15:36.370
We've searched every household

200
15:36.370 --> 15:37.730
except one residence.

201
15:37.910 --> 15:39.170
No sign of the suspect.

202
15:39.370 --> 15:40.920
Except one residence?

203
15:41.300 --> 15:42.230
What do you mean?

204
15:42.890 --> 15:43.530
B-Because...

205
15:43.530 --> 15:46.390
That residence belongs to Wu Buping, the Iron Lion.

206
15:48.650 --> 15:49.580
Why are you here?

207
15:50.180 --> 15:51.320
Hasn't your Iron Alliance

208
15:51.320 --> 15:53.120
caused enough trouble already?

209
15:54.910 --> 15:56.560
Who cares if he's a lion or a leopard?

210
15:56.560 --> 15:57.620
Search that place!

211
15:57.850 --> 15:58.350
Let's go!

212
15:58.350 --> 15:58.980
Yes, sir!

213
16:10.410 --> 16:11.070
Godfather.

214
16:24.660 --> 16:25.720
Who are you people?

215
16:25.920 --> 16:27.270
You just barge in without even knocking?

216
16:27.270 --> 16:28.330
Search this place!

217
16:28.780 --> 16:29.560
Search every corner!

218
16:29.560 --> 16:30.620
Who are you people?

219
16:35.180 --> 16:36.410
Dr. Su?

220
16:38.730 --> 16:39.650
Eunuch Zhu.

221
16:56.130 --> 16:57.530
So he's Zhu Buhua.

222
17:02.790 --> 17:05.680
So you're Wu Dingyuan, Wu Buping's son?

223
17:06.500 --> 17:07.130
Yes, I am.

224
17:42.870 --> 17:43.530
Godfather.

225
17:43.870 --> 17:44.730
We found no one.

226
17:48.390 --> 17:49.200
Dr. Su,

227
17:50.590 --> 17:52.190
sorry to have disturbed you.

228
17:56.650 --> 17:57.180
Let's go!

229
17:58.100 --> 17:58.600
Hurry!

230
18:31.010 --> 18:32.070
What are you doing?

231
18:32.810 --> 18:34.410
Let go!

232
18:35.760 --> 18:37.920
Taking advantage of the situation, huh?

233
18:37.920 --> 18:40.240
Dr. Su, that was quite a performance.

234
18:40.920 --> 18:41.980
Why did you help us?

235
18:45.920 --> 18:47.130
I was helping myself.

236
18:55.910 --> 18:56.740
I advise you

237
18:57.200 --> 18:58.660
not to get any funny ideas.

238
18:58.740 --> 18:59.940
I'll be watching you.

239
19:04.420 --> 19:05.050
Come out.

240
19:06.760 --> 19:07.560
They're gone.

241
19:20.960 --> 19:21.760
Rectifier Yu.

242
19:23.420 --> 19:23.890
Yes, Your Highness.

243
19:23.890 --> 19:24.630
Rise.

244
19:25.810 --> 19:26.650
From now on,

245
19:26.850 --> 19:29.180
you need not observe palace formalities,

246
19:29.220 --> 19:30.760
lest it arouse suspicion.

247
19:32.630 --> 19:33.890
Go keep watch outside.

248
19:34.200 --> 19:35.410
I'll rest for a while.

249
19:35.630 --> 19:37.200
We'll depart as early as possible tomorrow.

250
19:37.200 --> 19:38.330
Yes, Your Highness.

251
19:46.200 --> 19:47.650
I'm retiring for the night.

252
19:47.650 --> 19:49.050
You may all leave as well.

253
20:01.570 --> 20:03.000
Didn't you hear me?

254
20:03.500 --> 20:04.570
You may leave.

255
20:05.320 --> 20:06.410
I'm going to bed.

256
20:09.810 --> 20:10.740
What do you mean?

257
20:11.410 --> 20:12.480
This is my house.

258
20:12.500 --> 20:13.900
Where am I supposed to go?

259
20:14.120 --> 20:15.880
No, what are you doing?

260
20:16.650 --> 20:17.200
Go.

261
20:17.310 --> 20:17.870
Wait...

262
20:18.150 --> 20:19.810
No. Why are you indulging him?

263
20:20.590 --> 20:23.180
Just because he's royal, he can do whatever he likes?

264
20:23.180 --> 20:24.290
This is my home.

265
20:34.180 --> 20:35.310
Good-for-Nothing.

266
20:35.360 --> 20:35.890
Where are you going?

267
20:35.890 --> 20:37.850
Wherever I want. It's none of your business.

268
20:37.850 --> 20:38.290
You...

269
20:38.650 --> 20:39.410
-You... -What are you doing?

270
20:39.410 --> 20:41.220
-What are you doing? -You can't leave!

271
20:41.220 --> 20:43.080
We can't afford any more trouble.

272
20:44.960 --> 20:47.000
Zhu Buhua has already been to my house.

273
20:47.000 --> 20:48.570
What more trouble could there possibly be?

274
20:48.570 --> 20:49.830
Once your Crown Prince

275
20:50.310 --> 20:51.790
has rested enough at my house,

276
20:51.790 --> 20:53.590
hurry up and leave, understand?

277
20:53.790 --> 20:54.760
From now on,

278
20:55.550 --> 20:56.810
we go our separate ways

279
20:56.960 --> 20:58.490
and owe each other nothing.

280
20:58.540 --> 20:58.890
Wait.

281
20:58.890 --> 20:59.810
Give it back to me!

282
20:59.810 --> 21:00.370
Wait.

283
21:00.630 --> 21:01.090
Give it to me.

284
21:01.090 --> 21:03.790
The 2,000 taels of silver you mentioned before...

285
21:03.790 --> 21:05.960
Don't you want to earn that money anymore?

286
21:05.960 --> 21:06.890
What do you mean?

287
21:09.240 --> 21:10.610
How about we make a deal?

288
21:11.810 --> 21:14.290
You help me escort the Crown Prince

289
21:14.870 --> 21:16.070
safely back to Beijing...

290
21:16.070 --> 21:17.600
Let me stop you right there.

291
21:17.810 --> 21:18.480
Beijing?

292
21:19.200 --> 21:21.060
Escort you all the way to Beijing?

293
21:21.160 --> 21:22.760
That job could get me killed.

294
21:23.090 --> 21:24.220
Two thousand taels?

295
21:24.570 --> 21:26.430
I wouldn't do it for 20,000 taels.

296
21:26.650 --> 21:27.130
You...

297
21:27.700 --> 21:28.650
It's not for you!

298
21:28.890 --> 21:30.160
It's for your father!

299
21:32.050 --> 21:32.980
Little Xingren.

300
21:33.940 --> 21:35.050
Stick to the point,

301
21:35.650 --> 21:37.710
and leave my papa out of this, hear me?

302
21:38.000 --> 21:38.440
You...

303
21:38.460 --> 21:40.050
As the chief constable of the Yingtian Prefectural Office,

304
21:40.050 --> 21:41.590
he's failed to solve a single one of the several grave cases

305
21:41.590 --> 21:43.050
that arose in a single day.

306
21:47.670 --> 21:49.560
Do you think he can escape blame?

307
21:52.870 --> 21:54.550
Using my papa to pressure me, huh?

308
21:54.550 --> 21:57.210
It'd certainly be best if he could escape blame.

309
21:58.910 --> 22:01.840
But if you can escort the Crown Prince and earn merit,

310
22:01.870 --> 22:03.570
I'm sure someone as clever as you

311
22:03.570 --> 22:04.810
doesn't need me

312
22:05.440 --> 22:07.650
to spell out what's at stake.

313
22:39.050 --> 22:39.650
He Si!

314
22:40.130 --> 22:40.680
He Si!

315
22:42.180 --> 22:42.680
Envoy.

316
22:43.050 --> 22:43.540
What's wrong?

317
22:43.540 --> 22:44.580
Gather more men

318
22:44.850 --> 22:47.500
and come with me to Wu Buping's house to catch Good-for-Nothing.

319
22:47.500 --> 22:48.960
Catch Good-for-Nothing?

320
22:49.020 --> 22:50.020
No need for that many.

321
22:50.020 --> 22:52.070
Just storm in with his sister tied up as a hostage.

322
22:52.070 --> 22:52.910
We're going there to catch him,

323
22:52.910 --> 22:53.920
not rob the place.

324
22:54.630 --> 22:57.290
Good-for-Nothing isn't as simple as you think.

325
22:57.390 --> 22:58.000
Envoy,

326
22:58.390 --> 23:00.650
after what happened at Xinghua Restaurant, our men were scattered.

327
23:00.650 --> 23:02.240
Everyone is either in hiding or lying low.

328
23:02.240 --> 23:04.440
Where are we supposed to find that many men?

329
23:04.440 --> 23:05.840
This isn't a discussion!

330
23:25.650 --> 23:26.240
Eunuch.

331
23:29.850 --> 23:32.380
Imperial Physician Li requests an audience.

332
23:33.440 --> 23:34.440
Let him in.

333
23:41.660 --> 23:43.980
Eunuch Zhu, Lord Zheng has regained consciousness.

334
23:43.980 --> 23:45.260
Although he is still somewhat confused,

335
23:45.260 --> 23:46.810
his physical injuries are no longer serious.

336
23:46.810 --> 23:49.210
He can get out of bed after a few days of rest.

337
23:54.740 --> 23:55.720
After he woke up,

338
23:55.810 --> 23:56.870
did he meet anyone?

339
23:56.940 --> 23:58.070
Did he say anything?

340
23:59.340 --> 23:59.970
Eunuch,

341
24:00.740 --> 24:02.850
h-he only asked me about something,

342
24:02.870 --> 24:04.310
a-and has seen no one else.

343
24:04.310 --> 24:05.170
What did he ask?

344
24:05.370 --> 24:08.440
Lord Zheng o-only asked me where he was

345
24:08.720 --> 24:10.000
and how badly he was hurt.

346
24:10.000 --> 24:12.330
I... answered him truthfully.

347
24:14.000 --> 24:15.130
Did he ask you...

348
24:21.810 --> 24:22.480
Alright.

349
24:23.940 --> 24:24.890
You may leave.

350
24:25.200 --> 24:27.390
Make sure Lord Zheng gets plenty of rest

351
24:27.390 --> 24:29.250
and don't let anyone disturb him.

352
24:30.070 --> 24:30.610
Leave.

353
24:30.910 --> 24:31.480
Yes.

354
24:38.200 --> 24:38.860
Godfather,

355
24:39.160 --> 24:40.360
the entire city is now under curfew,

356
24:40.360 --> 24:41.920
and checkpoints are set up everywhere.

357
24:41.920 --> 24:43.920
However capable the Crown Prince may be,

358
24:43.920 --> 24:45.750
he can't leave Jinling.

359
24:54.180 --> 24:56.110
Speak if you have something to say.

360
25:00.180 --> 25:01.000
I...

361
25:02.180 --> 25:03.840
I won't go to Beijing with you.

362
25:04.590 --> 25:06.850
My father and sister are still here.

363
25:07.110 --> 25:09.290
Now that things have gotten so out of hand,

364
25:09.290 --> 25:11.750
I'm afraid my papa won't escape punishment.

365
25:11.990 --> 25:14.250
My sister still doesn't know any better,

366
25:14.810 --> 25:16.740
so I can't stop worrying about her.

367
25:17.240 --> 25:18.700
Still, I want to thank you.

368
25:19.020 --> 25:20.080
At Xuanjin Bridge,

369
25:20.570 --> 25:21.570
you saved my life.

370
25:21.830 --> 25:23.760
I'll see you safely out of Jinling.

371
25:23.960 --> 25:26.160
That's a promise I will certainly keep.

372
25:29.310 --> 25:33.290
Don't you want to seize this opportunity to make something of yourself?

373
25:33.290 --> 25:34.410
I'm

374
25:35.050 --> 25:36.650
not cut out to be an official.

375
25:36.660 --> 25:38.240
I'm quite content to remain

376
25:38.830 --> 25:40.160
an ordinary constable.

377
25:50.760 --> 25:51.940
Don't let that weigh on your mind.

378
25:51.940 --> 25:53.940
It's just an "infirmity," isn't it?

379
25:55.050 --> 25:56.410
I asked the two of them about it.

380
25:56.410 --> 25:58.700
But I don't think they are necessarily right.

381
25:58.700 --> 26:01.090
"Infirmity" just means being sick, right?

382
26:01.090 --> 26:03.890
And if it's a sickness, it can definitely be cured.

383
26:09.370 --> 26:09.890
Okay.

384
26:12.810 --> 26:13.890
I'm rather tired.

385
26:14.390 --> 26:15.390
You may leave now.

386
26:23.920 --> 26:24.890
Actually...

387
26:26.160 --> 26:27.570
I worry about my papa too.

388
26:28.720 --> 26:31.240
I've always been at odds with him.

389
26:32.260 --> 26:33.990
I'm really afraid that one day,

390
26:34.570 --> 26:36.830
if something terrible happens to him...

391
26:38.210 --> 26:40.870
I won't have anyone to butt heads with.

392
26:43.420 --> 26:44.130
Papa...

393
26:46.760 --> 26:47.960
That word

394
26:49.660 --> 26:50.920
sounds so far away.

395
26:51.830 --> 26:53.560
I haven't called my father that

396
26:53.660 --> 26:54.960
in a very long time.

397
26:55.790 --> 26:57.630
All day it's the Ministry of Rites this, the Ministry of Rites that.

398
26:57.630 --> 26:59.830
Is the Ministry of Rites heaven itself?

399
27:07.290 --> 27:09.160
My respects, Father.

400
27:10.610 --> 27:11.440
Rise.

401
27:15.740 --> 27:18.160
Ever since your grandfather passed away,

402
27:18.530 --> 27:20.660
you've been opposing me at every turn.

403
27:20.680 --> 27:21.410
I have not.

404
27:21.550 --> 27:22.550
Still denying it?

405
27:24.460 --> 27:25.390
As your subject,

406
27:25.520 --> 27:26.920
it's my duty to offer remonstrance.

407
27:26.920 --> 27:28.330
But as your son, I ought even more to...

408
27:28.330 --> 27:29.370
Ought to what?

409
27:29.810 --> 27:32.370
Every time you open your mouth,

410
27:32.740 --> 27:35.000
it's either state affairs or politics.

411
27:35.480 --> 27:36.370
Let me tell you,

412
27:37.740 --> 27:39.000
a father is a father,

413
27:39.420 --> 27:40.720
and a son is a son.

414
27:41.130 --> 27:42.330
Between the two of us,

415
27:42.440 --> 27:43.810
we are father and son first,

416
27:43.810 --> 27:44.660
ruler and subject second...

417
27:44.660 --> 27:46.570
But you never let me finish a single sentence.

418
27:46.570 --> 27:48.420
You made me Crown Prince and let me oversee state affairs!

419
27:48.420 --> 27:49.570
But whenever something important comes up,

420
27:49.570 --> 27:50.740
you take matters into your own hands!

421
27:50.740 --> 27:52.240
But I am the Emperor.

422
27:52.260 --> 27:53.180
So what if you are the Emperor?

423
27:53.180 --> 27:54.150
Aren't emperors human?

424
27:54.150 --> 27:55.610
You just treat me as a pawn!

425
27:55.720 --> 27:57.090
So what if you're a pawn?

426
27:58.480 --> 27:59.520
I don't trust

427
27:59.920 --> 28:02.090
anyone in this Beijing palace,

428
28:03.760 --> 28:04.760
including you.

429
28:08.310 --> 28:09.570
I finally understand.

430
28:09.920 --> 28:11.450
So in Your Majesty's heart,

431
28:12.480 --> 28:14.210
I'm no different from the rest.

432
28:15.810 --> 28:16.570
Son,

433
28:17.150 --> 28:19.370
sooner or later you'll be Emperor too.

434
28:20.050 --> 28:23.580
And you, too, will have a Crown Prince and a Crown Prince's heir.

435
28:26.220 --> 28:27.240
Go to Jinling.

436
28:28.410 --> 28:30.760
Stay far away from your old man.

437
28:32.720 --> 28:34.810
From now on, make your own decisions.

438
28:34.830 --> 28:35.650
I understand.

439
28:39.390 --> 28:40.650
If you don't call him Papa,

440
28:40.650 --> 28:42.250
what do you call your father?

441
28:45.810 --> 28:46.810
What do I call him?

442
28:47.830 --> 28:49.890
"Emperor," "Your Majesty."

443
28:51.760 --> 28:54.200
Yesterday, I was still dressed in my royal robes.

444
28:54.200 --> 28:54.920
Today,

445
28:55.510 --> 28:56.380
I'm being

446
28:56.410 --> 28:58.090
hounded like a stray dog.

447
28:59.810 --> 29:00.480
Tell me...

448
29:03.660 --> 29:05.320
who would care about all this?

449
29:05.650 --> 29:07.050
Of course someone cares.

450
29:07.220 --> 29:09.200
Papa... Father...

451
29:10.630 --> 29:12.260
Whatever you call him, it doesn't matter.

452
29:12.260 --> 29:12.890
Anyway,

453
29:13.180 --> 29:13.650
a father

454
29:14.130 --> 29:15.570
is the only person in this world

455
29:15.570 --> 29:18.230
who genuinely wishes for his son to surpass him.

456
29:20.130 --> 29:21.330
By that logic,

457
29:21.940 --> 29:23.940
wouldn't a mother feel the same way?

458
29:25.650 --> 29:28.000
A mother... should be the same.

459
29:29.050 --> 29:30.450
But I don't have a mother.

460
29:35.110 --> 29:35.890
Perhaps I do.

461
29:37.110 --> 29:38.570
But I don't know who she is.

462
29:49.830 --> 29:51.630
Your father is a good constable.

463
29:54.390 --> 29:56.050
I'll issue an imperial pardon

464
29:57.760 --> 29:59.560
to keep your entire family safe.

465
30:02.460 --> 30:03.090
Thank you.

466
30:43.420 --> 30:44.090
Open it.

467
30:47.370 --> 30:50.830
This is from a case my father investigated a couple of days ago.

468
30:51.520 --> 30:54.720
A variety-play performer in the entertainment district

469
30:54.870 --> 30:56.760
lured and violated a female spectator.

470
30:56.760 --> 30:57.370
These are

471
30:57.500 --> 30:59.610
all pieces of evidence found at the scene.

472
30:59.610 --> 31:01.420
They haven't been handed over to the prefectural office yet.

473
31:01.420 --> 31:02.880
They'll come in handy now.

474
31:06.310 --> 31:07.480
How exactly?

475
31:08.160 --> 31:08.810
Me.

476
31:10.040 --> 31:12.460
Aren't I a constable of the Yingtian Prefectural Office?

477
31:12.460 --> 31:14.970
I escort criminals to the prefectural office to face justice.

478
31:14.970 --> 31:16.820
It's absolutely foolproof.

479
31:17.350 --> 31:18.590
No matter how they question us,

480
31:18.590 --> 31:20.190
there won't be a single flaw.

481
31:23.500 --> 31:24.760
He is the Crown Prince.

482
31:25.290 --> 31:27.690
How can he disguise himself as a performer?

483
31:28.750 --> 31:32.230
You're not trying to make a fool of him, are you?

484
31:32.500 --> 31:34.200
Then you play the lecherous criminal.

485
31:34.200 --> 31:35.710
But he must play

486
31:35.740 --> 31:37.160
the cuckolded husband.

487
31:37.790 --> 31:39.250
This absolutely won't do!

488
31:39.470 --> 31:41.250
Well, what's wrong with it?

489
31:43.250 --> 31:45.550
When he wears his royal robes, he's the Crown Prince.

490
31:45.550 --> 31:47.010
But once he takes them off,

491
31:47.160 --> 31:49.560
isn't he just a stray dog with no power left?

492
31:50.050 --> 31:50.940
Good-for-Nothing,

493
31:50.940 --> 31:52.740
you are outrageously insolent!

494
31:53.720 --> 31:54.840
Mocking His Highness

495
31:54.840 --> 31:56.240
will cost you your head!

496
31:57.410 --> 31:58.570
Don't put words in my mouth.

497
31:58.570 --> 31:59.850
I didn't say that.

498
32:00.220 --> 32:01.310
He said it himself.

499
32:01.330 --> 32:03.130
Go ask him if you don't believe me.

500
32:03.130 --> 32:04.590
Don't accuse me unfairly.

501
32:14.330 --> 32:15.960
"The aforementioned performer

502
32:15.960 --> 32:18.240
defiled a relative of Lord Yu Qian,

503
32:18.590 --> 32:20.650
Director of the Messenger's Office,

504
32:21.050 --> 32:23.310
and was caught in bed by Lord Yu himself."

505
32:23.830 --> 32:24.760
Give that to me. Let me see.

506
32:24.760 --> 32:26.090
Look for yourself then.

507
32:26.570 --> 32:29.050
"Out of regard for the honor of the official's relative,

508
32:29.050 --> 32:32.380
special permission has been granted to expedite the case."

509
32:39.890 --> 32:41.520
Isn't there another way?

510
32:43.290 --> 32:45.110
Like a bridegroom falling into a cesspit.

511
32:45.110 --> 32:47.520
Which matters more— your pride or your life?

512
32:47.520 --> 32:49.320
I never imagined that I, Yu Qian,

513
32:50.070 --> 32:52.050
would be made such a fool by you.

514
32:55.350 --> 32:56.680
There's no time to lose.

515
32:57.290 --> 32:59.160
Hurry, disguise the Crown Prince.

516
32:59.160 --> 33:00.000
How?

517
33:01.000 --> 33:02.460
Just work it out yourself.

518
33:07.920 --> 33:08.850
Your Highness,

519
33:09.390 --> 33:11.990
please take extra care of your wound on the way.

520
33:12.000 --> 33:13.260
I'll take my leave now.

521
33:20.440 --> 33:21.970
Dr. Su, where are you going?

522
33:22.630 --> 33:23.200
I...

523
33:23.680 --> 33:24.240
Go back.

524
33:24.940 --> 33:25.390
-What are you doing? -Go back!

525
33:25.390 --> 33:26.450
What are you doing?

526
33:27.240 --> 33:29.640
Now that you know His Highness's identity,

527
33:29.700 --> 33:31.090
we can't let you go.

528
33:32.610 --> 33:34.670
You must return to the capital with us

529
33:34.980 --> 33:38.440
so you can treat His Highness's injuries whenever necessary.

530
33:38.970 --> 33:40.430
As long as Zhu Buhua lives,

531
33:40.960 --> 33:42.290
I'm not going anywhere.

532
33:43.260 --> 33:44.310
Then I'll tie you up

533
33:44.310 --> 33:46.240
-and take you! -What are you doing?

534
33:47.630 --> 33:49.560
Dr. Su, you're an educated person.

535
33:49.720 --> 33:51.450
Now the whole city is our enemy.

536
33:52.130 --> 33:53.260
When the nest falls,

537
33:53.410 --> 33:54.940
can anything remain whole?

538
33:55.610 --> 33:56.540
Little Xingren,

539
33:57.180 --> 33:58.650
you're educated too.

540
33:58.830 --> 34:00.290
Can you be a bit more refined?

541
34:00.290 --> 34:02.200
Must you keep going on about holes?

542
34:02.200 --> 34:04.060
Dr. Su doesn't like hearing that.

543
34:04.270 --> 34:04.850
You...

544
34:06.570 --> 34:07.900
You good-for-nothing.

545
34:08.920 --> 34:10.520
You're not allowed to leave!

546
34:41.350 --> 34:42.080
Dr. Su.

547
34:46.679 --> 34:49.139
I'm indebted to you for treating my wound.

548
34:50.489 --> 34:52.090
Once I return to the capital,

549
34:52.219 --> 34:54.679
I shall make sure you are properly rewarded.

550
34:56.330 --> 34:57.520
If you're unwilling

551
34:57.960 --> 34:59.640
to go to the capital with me,

552
35:00.080 --> 35:01.610
then we will part ways here.

553
35:05.600 --> 35:06.400
Rest assured.

554
35:06.960 --> 35:08.080
If one day

555
35:09.350 --> 35:11.750
I successfully make it back to the capital,

556
35:11.810 --> 35:12.960
I will never

557
35:14.500 --> 35:15.810
spare Zhu Buhua.

558
35:18.770 --> 35:19.810
Y-Your Highness.

559
35:20.230 --> 35:22.430
Your Highness mustn't speak so rashly.

560
35:23.040 --> 35:25.240
Your arrow wound is still very serious.

561
35:25.410 --> 35:28.070
And right now, there's no one else we can rely on.

562
35:28.230 --> 35:29.090
Your Highness.

563
35:30.670 --> 35:31.520
Then I

564
35:32.290 --> 35:34.220
will accompany you to the capital.

565
35:54.230 --> 35:56.830
I, Zhu Zhanji, swear upon this incense burner:

566
35:59.290 --> 36:00.890
I shall return to the capital

567
36:01.890 --> 36:04.020
and capture the villain responsible.

568
36:05.540 --> 36:07.740
No matter how many hardships lie ahead,

569
36:09.230 --> 36:10.920
I shall never give up.

570
36:13.690 --> 36:15.490
May gods and men be my witnesses.

571
36:39.730 --> 36:40.860
Good-for-Nothing.

572
36:42.770 --> 36:45.900
This is the sacred vessel His Highness used for his oath.

573
36:46.980 --> 36:48.840
It must not be discarded lightly.

574
36:49.390 --> 36:50.600
Can you give it to me?

575
36:50.980 --> 36:51.850
Give it to you?

576
36:53.000 --> 36:53.850
No way.

577
36:54.600 --> 36:55.730
This incense burner

578
36:55.810 --> 36:57.890
is a birthday gift I gave my sister.

579
36:58.660 --> 37:00.520
I never intended to throw it away.

580
37:03.520 --> 37:04.380
How about this?

581
37:04.580 --> 37:05.640
I'll lend it to you.

582
37:05.890 --> 37:07.330
But once you leave Jinling,

583
37:07.330 --> 37:08.850
you have to give it back to me.

584
37:08.850 --> 37:09.600
Then

585
37:10.210 --> 37:12.410
we'll settle old and new accounts together.

586
37:12.410 --> 37:13.940
You know what I mean, right?

587
37:15.920 --> 37:16.850
Enough talking.

588
37:17.270 --> 37:17.890
Let's go.

589
37:43.000 --> 37:44.370
Did you hear the crying?

590
37:45.770 --> 37:46.770
I'm not deaf.

591
37:47.980 --> 37:48.910
Don't look back.

592
37:49.120 --> 37:50.040
Who's crying?

593
37:52.080 --> 37:54.340
Probably people from these households.

594
37:56.520 --> 37:57.650
Why are they crying?

595
38:00.420 --> 38:01.330
This alley

596
38:02.080 --> 38:03.410
is called Zongbo Alley.

597
38:03.600 --> 38:06.480
The Minister, Vice Minister, Directors, Vice Directors,

598
38:06.480 --> 38:09.870
and other senior officials of the Ministry of Rites all live here,

599
38:09.870 --> 38:10.920
hence the name.

600
38:11.910 --> 38:14.110
When Your Highness arrived in Jinling,

601
38:14.270 --> 38:17.370
the officials who came to welcome you at the Dongshuiguan Wharf

602
38:17.370 --> 38:19.230
were led by the Ministry of Rites.

603
38:19.750 --> 38:21.880
So when the treasure ship was blown up,

604
38:22.420 --> 38:25.620
the Ministry of Rites suffered the heaviest casualties.

605
38:26.210 --> 38:28.140
I'm afraid almost every household

606
38:29.600 --> 38:31.860
in Zongbo Alley is probably in mourning,

607
38:32.230 --> 38:34.690
with funeral banners hanging at every door.

608
39:11.730 --> 39:12.920
I'm too late again.

609
39:14.320 --> 39:16.180
That darned Zhu Buhua

610
39:17.190 --> 39:19.050
only knows how to alert the enemy.

611
39:21.580 --> 39:22.210
Envoy!

612
39:23.100 --> 39:23.730
Envoy!

613
39:43.730 --> 39:44.290
Envoy...

614
39:45.850 --> 39:46.410
Envoy!

615
40:00.060 --> 40:03.190
Do you still get headaches when you see the Crown Prince?

616
40:04.350 --> 40:05.890
It's not exactly a headache.

617
40:05.890 --> 40:08.210
I can't quite describe the feeling.

618
40:09.060 --> 40:10.000
It's almost

619
40:10.520 --> 40:12.080
as if there's some kind of vision

620
40:12.080 --> 40:14.040
that I just can't get out of my head.

621
40:14.680 --> 40:17.010
Is the vision related to the Crown Prince?

622
40:20.080 --> 40:21.140
How should I put it?

623
40:21.290 --> 40:22.440
Think carefully.

624
40:23.230 --> 40:24.830
You must've seen him before.

625
40:25.020 --> 40:26.790
Where would someone like me have

626
40:26.790 --> 40:28.520
ever had the chance to meet him?

627
40:29.830 --> 40:31.440
But then again,

628
40:31.790 --> 40:33.720
the more I try to stay away from him,

629
40:33.810 --> 40:35.720
the harder it becomes to shake him off.

630
40:35.720 --> 40:36.470
What a curse.

631
40:54.580 --> 40:55.250
Iron Lion!

632
40:56.600 --> 40:57.290
Envoy.

633
40:59.620 --> 41:00.330
Papa!

634
41:06.810 --> 41:07.370
Papa.

635
41:07.650 --> 41:08.910
Alright, alright now.

636
41:14.620 --> 41:16.020
How did you get the wound?

637
41:17.250 --> 41:17.890
Yulu.

638
41:18.640 --> 41:19.840
You can go back first.

639
41:21.250 --> 41:22.380
It's okay. Go ahead.

640
41:23.810 --> 41:25.120
I'll come find you later.

641
41:25.120 --> 41:25.690
Go.

642
41:26.370 --> 41:26.920
Go.

643
41:28.140 --> 41:28.730
Go.

644
41:29.980 --> 41:30.480
Go.

645
41:35.480 --> 41:36.880
Not even a word of thanks.

646
41:37.020 --> 41:38.380
Thank you, Envoy.

647
41:40.310 --> 41:42.370
Yulu has been with me, so don't worry.

648
41:43.600 --> 41:44.520
But...

649
41:45.480 --> 41:48.210
while you were on night duty, your son

650
41:48.460 --> 41:50.690
brought a girl to bed and fooled around.

651
41:57.830 --> 41:58.920
It seems...

652
42:04.980 --> 42:07.510
He's not the one we're looking for, after all.

653
42:07.690 --> 42:09.600
Exactly, Envoy. Exactly.

654
42:16.120 --> 42:16.780
Go back now.

655
42:17.040 --> 42:18.040
Thank you, Envoy.

656
42:23.080 --> 42:24.080
Keep an eye on them

657
42:24.560 --> 42:26.160
and see where they are going.

658
42:26.770 --> 42:27.500
Understood.

659
42:31.910 --> 42:32.520
Papa.

660
42:33.080 --> 42:35.370
What exactly do they want with my brother?

661
42:35.370 --> 42:36.830
They got the wrong person.

662
42:38.920 --> 42:40.770
But while they were holding me,

663
42:40.960 --> 42:43.560
they kept asking about Dingyuan's childhood.

664
42:43.910 --> 42:45.170
What did you tell them?

665
42:45.790 --> 42:47.850
How would I know about his childhood?

666
42:48.020 --> 42:50.020
I only remember he was in poor health

667
42:50.020 --> 42:51.420
and often had headaches,

668
42:51.770 --> 42:54.000
and you kept finding doctors for him.

669
42:54.560 --> 42:57.220
He doesn't even remember much about it himself.

670
42:57.370 --> 42:58.750
Why did you tell them all that?

671
42:58.750 --> 43:00.410
-I... -Why did you say so much?

672
43:00.690 --> 43:02.490
Am I not allowed to say anything?

673
43:02.920 --> 43:03.690
Forget it.

674
43:03.910 --> 43:05.170
We'll go find him right now.

675
43:05.170 --> 43:06.560
Find him, and then we'll leave Jinling.

676
43:06.560 --> 43:07.350
Come on, let's go.

677
43:07.350 --> 43:08.410
I'm not leaving!

678
43:08.730 --> 43:09.710
Explain it to me clearly first.
